    "description": "Source: Kobi / Joyce doc feedback, 2026-08-10.\n\nObjective: strip standard buttons from LIST VIEWS (search layouts / list view button config) on: Deal, Study Link Click, Sign Up, Deal Rep Assignment, Account.\n\nRemove on ALL five objects:\n\n* Import\n\n* Change Owner\n\n* Printable View\n\n* Assign Label\n\n'New' button:\n\n* KEEP on: Account, Deal\n\n* REMOVE on: Study Link Click, Sign Up, Deal Rep Assignment\n\nRationale for removing New: these three are created by automation/integration only (SLC intake, Sign-Up from SLC automation, DRA from CMS sync). Aligns with BUILD-114 (reps cannot create Sign-Up records).\n\nImplementation note: list-view buttons are controlled per object via Search Layouts > List View, not the page layout. Applies to Lightning list views; verify in Console app context.\n\nDependency: overlaps BUILD-112 (Search Layouts: key fields on Recently Viewed) and BUILD-111 (reps cannot manage list views) — do these in one sitting.",
